rem Snippet: TPS Camera
rem Description: A third-person camera behind an object. Call TpsCamera(object number) once per frame before sync.

rem Obj is the number of the object to follow, usually the player.
function TpsCamera(Obj)
   rem 15 units behind, 6 above; smoothing 10 (1 is rigid, higher is smoother)
   set camera to follow object position x(Obj), object position y(Obj), object position z(Obj), object angle y(Obj), 15, 6, 10, 0
   point camera object position x(Obj), object position y(Obj) + 2, object position z(Obj)
endfunction
